        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8521AS, Clear Crystal Astoria Knob with Rectangle Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Astoria Crystal Knob with Rectangular Rose is a great choice for transitional homes. The cut crystal knob and the rectangular rosette are paired to make a beautiful knobset that marries the old and new world styles perfectly. The Crystal Astoria Knob with Rectangle Rose will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is available in passage, privacy, and dummy functions. The Rectangle Rose is available in a wide array of finishes. This Crystal Astoria Knob with Rectangle Rose is a classic but still has a contemporary feel, which is the reason it is so popular among designers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Astoria Knob with Rectangle Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Crystal Knob with Rectangular Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Stem: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-9-finish.jpg?v=1704354579\" width=\"597\" height=\"89\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Astoria Crystal Knob with Rectangular Rose",
                "description": "The Astoria Crystal Knob with Rectangular Rose is a great choice for transitional homes. The half round crystal knob and the rectangular rosette are paired to make a beautiful knobset that marries the old and new world styles perfectly. The Clear Crystal Astoria Knob with Rectangle Rose will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is available in passage, privacy, and dummy functions. The Rectangle Rose is available in a wide array of finishes. This Clear Crystal Astoria Knob with Rectangle Rose is a classic but still has a contemporary feel, which is the reason it is so popular among designers.",
